OL,3,ANvidia boss says AI 'doesn't need new
OL,4,Alaws' as safety concerns grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia is the biggest company in the
OL,7,Fworld by valuation, with its profits
OL,8,Fhaving boomed as a result of rampant
OL,9,Fdemand for the AI computing chips it
OL,10,Fmakes.
OL,12,FHuang's stance on AI safety contrasts
OL,13,Fwith several current and former
OL,14,Femployees of AI-focused firms who have
OL,15,Frecently expressed fears that the
OL,16,Ftechnology could wipe out humanity.
